{
  "id": "ECC.11",
  "number": "11",
  "bookId": "ECC",
  "reference": "Ecclesiastes 11",
  "verseCount": 10,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ECC 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Invest your money in foreign trade, and one of these days you will make a profit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Put your investments in several places — many places, in fact — because you never know what kind of bad luck you are going to have in this world.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No matter in which direction a tree falls, it will lie where it fell. When the clouds are full, it rains. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If you wait until the wind and the weather are just right, you will never sow anything and never harvest anything. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God made everything, and you can no more understand what he does than you understand how new life begins in the womb of a pregnant woman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do your sowing in the morning and in the evening, too. You never know whether it will all grow well or whether one sowing will do better than the other.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It is good to be able to enjoy the pleasant light of day. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be grateful for every year you live. No matter how long you live, remember that you will be dead much longer. There is nothing at all to look forward to.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Young people, enjoy your youth. Be happy while you are still young. Do what you want to do, and follow your heart's desire. But remember that God is going to judge you for whatever you do.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't let anything worry you or cause you pain. You aren't going to be young very long.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
